2 CONT 	A "capellanía de misas" was established and son Gerónimo was the "albacea."
2 CONT
2 CONT Jerónimo was the son of Captain Juan de Huerta and María de Quijas y Escalante.  Juan was buried in Aguascalientes 1 Feb 1666.  He had made his will in Mexico City, before the "escribano real," Joseph de Haro.
