1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Manuel Gómez''' and Ana Vicenta, the parents of Francisco Gómez, were both natives of the Villa de Coina, Portugal, where they died when Francisco was a small child. It appears that Francisco and his only brothe
2 CONC r, Alonso Gómez, were then raised in Lisbon. Alonso became a Franciscan friar in Lisbon, whereas Francisco sought his destiny in the Americas. 
