1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Pedro Gómez de Portugal married 18 June 1613, Villa de Santa María de los Lagos, Nueva Galicia, with Isabel Ortiz Parada (she may have been related Diego Ortiz Saavedra y Parada, alcalde ordinario of Lagos in 1609)
2 CONC . 
2 CONT
2 CONT This couple was enumerated in the 1669 census of Lagos. 
2 CONT
2 CONT They were the parents of five known children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1) Ysabel Gómez Ortiz, baptized 30 October 1616, Villa de Santa María de los Lagos; 
2 CONT
2 CONT 2) José Gómez, who follows; 
2 CONT
2 CONT 3) Juan Gómez Ortiz, baptized 2 January 1635, Villa de Santa María de los Lagos; 
2 CONT
2 CONT 4) Luisa Gómez Ortiz, baptized 23 February 1637, Villa de Santa María de los Lagos; 5) Pedro Gómez Ortiz, baptized 13 April 1639, Villa de Santa María de los Lagos.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://dev.newmexicohistory.org/filedetails_docs.php?fileID=22423
