2 CONC caba and Juana Maria Gonzalez. He married Beatriz Lopez de Fuenllana (born in Patzcuaro, Michoacán)...
2 CONT
2 CONT Mateo de Rubalcaba was born in Villa de Lierganes, Cudeyo, Santander, Spain and he married Juana Maria Gonzalez, the daughter of Ruy Gonzalez (one of the conquistadors).
