2 CONT 	a) Diego Díaz Montañez and Jacinta Carrillo de Sandi.  She, daughter of Diego Carrillo de Sandi and María López, whose parents were Mateo González de Ruvalcaba y López de Fuenllana and his first spouse, Gerónima Morales.  
