2 CONT Bernabé and Manuel de Montañez y Sotomayor married in Teocaltiche and stayed.  Brides were two sisters, Isabel and Elvira Carrillo de Sandi, respectively; on 14 June 1659 and 5 June 1666, respectively.  Daughters of Diego Carril
2 CONC lo de Sandi and María López (González de Ruvalcaba y Morales).  Have FGS for both families.  Bernabé, with two sons, five daughters.  Six married in Aguascalientes; one son had marriage information there, but wedding probably 
2 CONC held in Teocaltiche.  All got hitched between 1680-89.  Of Manuel's five known seeds, two have married also made the mistake in Ags., in 1690 and 1701.
2 CONT 	A sibling of the two mentioned above was Teresa Carrillo de Sandi, chr. in Teocaltiche 4 Apr 1640, first nuptials there 27 Apr 1664 to Nicolás de Villalobos y Macías Valadés.  Second husband was Juan Díaz Montañez c.1671-Fir
2 CONC st child christened 20 Dec 1672.  Think Juan and Miguel Díaz aka Montañez (md. in Pinos to Josefa Díaz or Marrón) were son and father; perhaps brothers, descendants of Juan Díaz de la Huerta and Isabel Marín de las Ruelas (p
2 CONC age 54 of index).  Further information is needed.
2 CONT
