1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From [http://www.santafenm.gov/DocumentView.aspx?DID=3368  Founders of the Villa de Santa Fe]:
2 CONT
2 CONT On the morning of May 4, 1662, Sargento Mayor Francisco Gómez Robledo was awakened in his house on the corner of the plaza of Santa Fe at 5 a.m. by sounds of a commotion. Acting under orders of Inquisition officials, Don Juan Mans
2 CONC o, a chief constable of the Inquisition of Mexico City, arrested Gómez Robledo in his home.
2 CONT
