2 CONT In 1570, Martín Navarro , married to Petronila de Moctezuma, obtained the grant of a large cattle site, located between the towns of Mexticacán and Acasico. [1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage dispensation from his great-great-granddaughter Tomasa de la Rosa de Ulloa [2]
2 CONT
2 CONT In the town of Nochistlan on said day, month and year Before his
2 CONT Merced said Mr. Vicar seemed Matheo Gonzalez of
2 CONT Robalacava Spanish neighbor of this said town and declare
2 CONT that Bartolome Rodriguez Bajo, widower of Teresa Ponce and Doña
2 CONT Tomasa Rosa de Ulloa legitimate daughter of Pedro de Ulloa
2 CONT Marquez who is currently trying to get married
2 CONT They are relatives in the fourth degree of affinity
2 CONT by lawful copulation because the said Teresa Ponce was
2 CONT daughter of Nicolas Ponce granddaughter of Doña Juana de Siordia
2 CONT great-granddaughter of María Gabay and Teresa granddaughter of Martín
2 CONT Navarro and Doña Petronila de Montezuma...
2 CONT Martín Navarro and Doña Petronila de Montezuma de los
2 CONT which is also in the same fourth grade
2 CONT said Doña Tomasa Roza de Ulloa because she is Pedro's daughter
2 CONT of Ulloa Marquez granddaughter of María Ruiz de Esparza great-granddaughter
2 CONT of Francisca Gabai and third granddaughter of the sayings
2 CONT Martin Navarro and Doña Petronila Montesuma
2 CONT coz and legitimate parents of the said María Gabay and Fran
2 CONT cisca Gabay from whom these two descendants were procreated
