1 NOTE {geni:about_me} In the villa of Aguascalientes on the twenty-eighth day of March ninety-four, I married in facie ecclesiæ Juan de Medina Altuna, Spaniard, neighbor of this jurisdiction [Aguascalientes], legitimate son of Cristóbal
2 CONC  de Medina Altuna and Maria de Ávila , deceased, with Teresa Diaz de Lomas , Spaniard, neighbor of this villa, legitimate daughter of Antonio Diaz de Lomas and of Luisa de Tiscareño, deceased having preceded the diligences ordered
2 CONC  by the Holy Council of Trent, reading three admonitions inter missarum solemniaon holidays, the first being Sunday, the fourteenth of March, the second Friday, the nineteenth day of the Lord Saint Joseph, and the third, the twent
2 CONC y-first of said month. And when expressing his wishes, Don Joseph de Muñatones, Joseph de Guzmán, and Salvador de Villalobos were witnesses and for the record I signed it.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sebastian Murillo Ordoñez
