1 NOTE {geni:about_me} In the town of Aguascalientes in the parish church on four days in the month of March of one thousand six hundred and sixty-nine years, Mr. Bartolomé de Soto y Carvajal married and held a funeral service for Juan D
2 CONC elgado and Margarita López de Lizardi, neighbors of this parish, Having preceded all the procedures established by the Holy Council and read three admonitions on three inter missarum solemnia holidays, which were Sunday the twenty
2 CONC -fourth of the month of February, and Friday the first, and Sunday the third of this month of March, and no impediment resulted, they were witnesses are Mr. Bernabé Altamirano, and Diego Gonzáles, and Gaspar Serrano and for the re
2 CONC cord I signed it above .
